    "不听牌的家合计付 3000 点给听牌的家；庄家听牌则连庄，下一局加 1 本场。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不听牌的家合计付 3000 点给听牌的家；庄家听牌则连庄，下一局加 1 本场。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不聴者が聴牌者に計3000点支払い。親が聴牌なら連荘（＋1本場）。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noten players pay 3000 pts total to tenpai players. Dealer repeats (+1 honba) if tenpai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
